        "hinglish": "Pulling se streeling: kai mein -ess lagta hai (actor → actress), kai ka shabd hi alag hai (horse → mare, fox → vixen).",
        "en": "Masculine to feminine: many add -ess (actor → actress), some are different words (horse → mare, fox → vixen)."
      }
